<tr><td><a href="img/umiushi046.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/umiushi046_small.jpg" width="378" /></a><a href="img/umiushi047.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/umiushi047_small.jpg" width="378" /></a></td></tr>
